  "passives": [
    {
      "name": "Thunderflash",
      "description": "When another nearby character in the party obtains an Abundance Amulet created by Lightning Blade, Lightning Blade's CD is decreased by 1.5s."
    },
    {
      "name": "Resounding Roar",
      "description": "Increases the Energy Recharge effect granted by Lightning Blade's Abundance Amulet by 10% of the Traveler's Energy Recharge."
    },
    {
      "name": "Foreign Thundertrail",
      "description": "Draw new strength from journeys past. For every element you have resonated with, you gain additional {LINK#N10050001}buffs{/LINK}.\n\nIn addition, when nearby party members unleash an Elemental Burst, Traveler will receive 1 stack of Blade of Resounding Thunder, max 3 stacks. After obtaining 3 stacks of Blade of Resounding Thunder, performing a Charged Attack will consume all stacks of Blade of Resounding Thunder and transform into the special Charged Attack: Detonate.\n\nCharged Attack: Detonate\n· Each Charged Attack hit deals increased Electro DMG. Increase in DMG is equal to 100% of Traveler's ATK. \n· 3s after hitting the enemy, 1 additional lightning strike will be triggered, dealing Electro DMG equal to 200% of Traveler's ATK. 1 Abundance Amulet will also be created. This DMG is considered Charged Attack DMG.\n· Charged Attack: Detonate can be triggered up to once every 15s."
    }
  ],
